lf**:\n```\nnix-build -A python312Packages.relatorio https://github.com/r-ryantm/nixpkgs/archive/bdbcc39e80562e850c0e59362d89f6f90ee95880.tar.gz\n```\nOr:\n```\nnix build github:r-ryantm/nixpkgs/bdbcc39e80562e850c0e59362d89f6f90ee95880#python312Packages.relatorio\n```\n\nAfter you've downloaded or built it, look at the files and if there are any, run the binaries:\n```\nls -la /nix/store/pm7n89akddcclm1pmjl2fm55fwbjyhxw-python3.12-relatorio-0.11.1\nls -la /nix/store/pm7n89akddcclm1pmjl2fm55fwbjyhxw-python3.12-relatorio-0.11.1/bin\n```\n\n---\n\n</details>\n<br/>\n\n\n\n### Pre-merge build results\n\nWe have automatically built all packages that will get rebuilt due to\nthis change.\n\nThis gives evidence on whether the upgrade will break dependent packages.\nNote sometimes packages show up as _failed to build_ independent of the\nchange, simply because they are already broken on the target branch.\n\n## `nixpkgs-review` result\n\nGenerated using [`nixpkgs-review`](https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review).\n\nCommand: `nixpkgs-review`\n\n---\n### `x86_64-linux`\n<details>\n  <summary>:white_check_mark: 8 packages built:</summary>\n  <ul>\n    <li>python311Packages.relatorio</li>\n    <li>python311Packages.relatorio.dist</li>\n    <li>python311Packages.trytond</li>\n    <li>python311Packages.trytond.dist</li>\n    <li>python312Packages.relatorio</li>\n    <li>python312Packages.relatorio.dist</li>\n    <li>trytond (python312Packages.trytond)</li>\n    <li>trytond.dist (python312Packages.trytond.dist)</li>\n  </ul>\n</details>\n\n---\n\n###### Maintainer pings\n\ncc @johbo for [testing](https://github.com/ryantm/nixpkgs-update/blob/main/doc/nixpkgs-maintainer-faq.md#r-ryantm-opened-a-pr-for-my-package-what-do-i-do).\n\n> [!TIP]\n> As a maintainer, if your package is located under `pkgs/by-name/*`, you can comment **`@NixOS/nixpkgs-merge-bot merge`** to automatically merge this update using the [`nixpkgs-merge-bot`](https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs-merge-bot).\n\n---\n\n